        },
        {
          "text": " BWANA akamwambia Samweli, utamlilia Sauli hadi lini, kwa kuwa mimi nimemkataa asiwatawale Waisraeli? Ijaze pembe yako mafuta, uende, nami nitakutuma kwa Yese, Mbethlehemi; maana nimejipatia mfalme katika wanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
