        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini BWANA akamwambia Samweli, Usimtazame uso wake, wala urefu wa kimo chake; kwa maana mimi nimemkataa. BWANA haangalii kama binadamu aangaliavyo; maana wanadamu huitazama sura ya nje, bali BWANA huutazama moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
