        {
          "text": " Kisha Samweli akamwambia Yese, Watoto wako wote wapo hapa? Naye akasema, Amesalia mdogo wao, na tazama, anawachunga kondoo. Basi Samweli akamwambia Yese, Tuma watu, wamlete; kwa sababu hatutaketi hadi atakapokuja huku. ",
          "type": "text",
