                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo Samweli akaitwaa pembe yenye mafuta, akamtia mafuta kati ya ndugu zake; na Roho ya BWANA ikamjia Daudi kwa nguvu kuanzia siku ile. Basi Samweli akaondoka, akaenda zake Rama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
