              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit 22:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Daudi akamwendea Sauli, akasimama mbele yake, naye akampenda sana; naye akawa mtu wa kumchukulia silaha zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Sauli akatuma ujumbe kwa Yese, akasema, Tafadhali, mwache Daudi asimame mbele yangu; maana ameona kibali machoni pangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, ile roho mbaya kutoka kwa Mungu ilipomjia Sauli, ndipo Daudi alipokishika kinubi na kukipiga kwa mkono wake, naye Sauli akaburudishwa, na ile roho mbaya ikamwacha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
